Raya includes adaptations of component source from coss ui.

The adapted component surfaces are derived from the MIT-licensed UI source in
the coss repository at revision e937becd2d5ffb5c621eed6f8b1f223cbb6051e7.
Raya adapts import paths and icon implementations for its registry and
HugeIcons support; the surrounding Raya Studio, theme presets, and registry
metadata are original work.

